+# Mission 09 — Final Assembly Progress
+
+## Checkpoint scope
+
+Branch `mission-09-final-assembly` preserves the Mission 07–08 implementation on top of the Mission 06 patch-only integration. The private overlay repository contains a patch series rather than a second full source mirror; it materializes pinned CoopDX iOS upstream and applies permitted integration patches. Do not push to the public upstream remote.
+
+## Integrated and host-validated
+
+- CoopDX source tree materialized from the pinned iOS baseline plus the integration patch series, including the restored iOS touch art/layout, multi-touch ownership and cancellation, touch hit-priority/axis helpers, Metal state retention and failure-safe texture/sampler updates, and texture-cache rewind protection.
+- Four focused regression scripts pass: Metal combiner/MSL generation, SDL Metal-layer lifecycle, raw/DynOS shared texture-cache rewind, and touchscreen hit-priority/joystick math.
+- All four focused scripts pass with `SANITIZE=1 CC=clang` (ASan/UBSan).
+- A clean overlay materialization completed `make -j2` and linked `build/us_pc/sm64coopdx`; the source checkout also passed incremental `make -j2`. The clean materialized tree is recorded after the documentation commit.
+- Original reset-to-defaults control-editor action remains available. Existing saved positions are not overwritten on upgrade; users can explicitly restore the original layout. Fresh configurations use the original layout defaults. This avoids discarding custom placements during migration.
+
+## Evidence limits / outstanding
+
+- Public Apple harness runs `45757822398` and `45758034420` passed component-only iPhoneOS/ARM64 compilation, SDL/Metal adapter stub-contract linking, and generated MSL validation. They do not compile or link the complete CoopDX app.
+- Full app Apple compilation and IPA packaging remain blocked: the available private Actions route has the account spending restriction; public full-source publishing is not justified because no redistribution license for the upstream iOS source was identified; no reachable Mac host is available. No workaround was attempted.
+- No physical iPhone rendering, safe-area/orientation layout, touch feel, DynOS GPU rendering, or Metal resource lifetime has been verified on hardware.
+- `make test` requires `mupen64plus`, which is absent. The full Linux build and focused regression suite are the available host evidence.
+
+## Delivery record
+
+Delivery status:
+
+- Source branch/commit: `mission-09-final-assembly` / recorded in the final handoff.
+- Private overlay branch/commit: pending push verification.
+- Materialized source tree: recorded in the final handoff.
+- Clean materialized `make -j2`: exit 0; linked `build/us_pc/sm64coopdx`.
+- Focused tests: pass, normal and ASan/UBSan.
+- Apple component CI: runs `45757822398`, `45758034420` passed; no full app workflow.
+- iPhone/IPA: unavailable; not claimed.
